{"id":"1eb79833a139e232","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-smn-theorem.md","title":"s-m-n Theorem","display":"df-smn-theorem — s-m-n Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-smn-theorem","aliases":["88-df-smn-theorem"],"display":"df-smn-theorem — s-m-n Theorem","depends_on":["[[88-df-computable-function]]","[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-kleene-equality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-smn-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-smn-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smn-theorem — s-m-n Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\geq1\">\\(m,n\\geq1\\)</span> (arities)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e^{(r)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\varphi_e^{(r)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (effective numbering of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>-ary partial computable functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffNum}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{EffNum}_r\\)</span> (effective-numbering predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}\\)</span> (computability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> (Kleene equality, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\">\\(\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\\)</span> (uniform parameter-fixing predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smn\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\n\\leftrightarrow\nm,n\\in\\mathbb N^+\n\\land\\mathrm{EffNum}_n((\\varphi_e^{(n)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\n\\land\\mathrm{EffNum}_{m+n}((\\varphi_e^{(m+n)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\n\\land s_n^m:\\mathbb N^{m+1}\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_{m+1}(s_n^m)\n\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\\forall\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\n\\varphi_{s_n^m(e,\\vec x)}^{(n)}(\\vec y)\n\\simeq\n\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec x,\\vec y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smn\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\n\\leftrightarrow\nm,n\\in\\mathbb N^+\n\\land\\mathrm{EffNum}_n((\\varphi_e^{(n)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\n\\land\\mathrm{EffNum}_{m+n}((\\varphi_e^{(m+n)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\n\\land s_n^m:\\mathbb N^{m+1}\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_{m+1}(s_n^m)\n\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\\forall\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\n\\varphi_{s_n^m(e,\\vec x)}^{(n)}(\\vec y)\n\\simeq\n\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec x,\\vec y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_n^m\">\\(s_n^m\\)</span> : 总可计算的参数固化函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> : 编号为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>的部分可计算函数</li>\n<li>本文件定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}\\)</span>；存在性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2e54d7c09866228f\" href=\"?note=2e54d7c09866228f\" title=\"88-thm-smn\">88-thm-smn</a> 断言。</li>\n<li>该性质并非任意具有通用求值器的编号都自动满足；它明确要求统一的总\n可计算参数固化函数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-equality","status":"resolved","id":"5f7e8cd4c12441fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-kleene-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\varphi_e^{(r)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ (effective numbering of $r$-ary partial computable functions, see [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EffNum}_r$ (effective-numbering predicate, see [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}$ (computability predicate, see [[88-df-computable-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-equality","status":"resolved","id":"5f7e8cd4c12441fb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\simeq$ (Kleene equality, see [[88-df-kleene-equality]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"2e54d7c09866228f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本文件定义 $\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}$；存在性由 [[88-thm-smn]] 断言。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"m,n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"(\\varphi_e^{(r)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffNum}_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smn\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s_n^m)\n\\leftrightarrow\nm,n\\in\\mathbb N^+\n\\land\\mathrm{EffNum}_n((\\varphi_e^{(n)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\n\\land\\mathrm{EffNum}_{m+n}((\\varphi_e^{(m+n)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\n\\land s_n^m:\\mathbb N^{m+1}\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_{m+1}(s_n^m)\n\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\\forall\\vec y\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\n\\varphi_{s_n^m(e,\\vec x)}^{(n)}(\\vec y)\n\\simeq\n\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec x,\\vec 